      "buildCommand": "cargo build -p cua-cli",
      "buildDirectory": "libs/cua",
      "extractionMethod": "dump-docs",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "index",
          "outputFile": "index.mdx",
          "extractCommand": "${CARGO_TARGET_DIR:-target}/debug/cua dump-docs --type all"
        },
        {
          "type": "cli",
          "outputFile": "cli/index.mdx",
          "extractCommand": "${CARGO_TARGET_DIR:-target}/debug/cua dump-docs --type cli"
        },
        {
          "type": "mcp",
          "outputFile": "mcp-tools/index.mdx",
          "extractCommand": "${CARGO_TARGET_DIR:-target}/debug/cua dump-docs --type mcp"
        },
        {
          "type": "nav",
          "outputFile": "meta.json",
          "extractCommand": null
        }
      ],
      "enabled": true,
      "notes": "Renders reference/index.mdx, reference/cli/ (one page per command group) and reference/mcp-tools/ (one page per tool group) from the hidden `cua dump-docs` (the clap definition and the MCP tool list) with the shared renderers in lib/, plus scripts/docs-generators/cli-specs/cua.json, the docs CLI-shape lane's oracle. Examples come from each command's clap `after_help` (a cua-cli test parses every one)."
